      "mergeID": "668ff528ee54709beb72f19c",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Very bizarre and rare bug that has only happened once, possibly not open beta related.\n\nFriend and I joined the same world instance using a portal. Both players make it to the instance, but I only see myself in the instance and not my friend. My friend can see me in the instance, moving around just fine. My friend appears outside the instance on the social list.\n\nThis same issue persisted to 3 more worlds, where I joined the world first, then the friend followed, and I still couldn't see the friend but the friend could see me. Friend is on Live if that matters.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1468] Can't see friend in instance, but friend can see me",
